 s. Airlifted to hospital\, Rushdie survived\, barely\, and his wife Rach
 el Eliza Griffiths began filming immediately\, capturing an unfiltered v
 iew of his recovery\, return to life and how he regained his spirit and 
 hope for the future.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1299581
