SUMMARY:Aileen Wuornos: Damsel of Death
DESCRIPTION:Aileen Wuornos: Damsel of Death re-examines the crimes and li
 fe of one of America’s most notorious female killers\, drawing on FBI 
 case files and testimony from Brian Jarvis\, the lead detective who inve
 stigated Wuornos and questioned her following her arrest. Beginning with
  the murder of Richard Mallory in Florida in November 1989\, the documen
 tary traces a series of killings that left seven men dead over the follo
 wing 11 months. As bodies were discovered along Florida’s highways\, a
 ll shot multiple times\, investigators began searching for the person re
 sponsible.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/tv/338377
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/338377
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
