DTSTAMP:20261026T120350Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Cosmic Symphony
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Laura Karpman\n\nFour iconic instruments\, includ
 ing The Wizard of Oz and A Star Is Born pianos\, all lost in the 2025 Lo
 s Angeles Fires\, are celebrated by their musicians\, culminating in an 
 animated send-off towards an imagined future\, a Cosmic Symphony. Direct
 ed by Oscar-nominated composer Laura Karpman\, and featuring John Clayto
 n\, Susie Chung\, Starr Parodi and Diane Warren\, Cosmic Symphony explor
