 nd early ’80s with the original members of Jimmy Buffett's Coral Reefe
 r Band as they recount their contributions to iconic albums\, life on to
 ur\, and the lasting impact they had in shaping a unique and enduring ge
 nre of music.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1631540
