SUMMARY:All About the Money
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Sinéad O'Shea\n\nA son of one of America’s wea
 lthiest families creates a communist revolutionary base in rural Massach
 usetts as a means of disrupting the capitalist system he grew up in\, bu
 t has now come to despise. It’s the starting point of an astonishing j
 ourney.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1595207
