SUMMARY:Language of the Wind
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Shimataver Igbawua\n\nThe story follows 16-year-o
 ld Shatu\, who has spent her life tending cattle but secretly longs for 
 city life. The day after her wedding to her traditional cousin Ardo (17)
 \, she finds a potential path to escape. As they lead their cattle to gr
 aze\, the silence and tension between them build into a heavy confrontat
 ion of unspoken truths and life-altering decisions on the plains.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1804839
