SUMMARY:Portraits of Slovak and Czech Britain
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Simona Vrabcová\n\nTransitioning from a photogra
 phic exhibition to film\, this documentary captures multi-generational s
 tories of Slovak and Czech migrants building lives and finding belonging
  in Britain. It highlights individuals who have impacted modern British 
 society through personal archives and intimate conversations.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.themoviedb.org/movie/1804814
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1804814
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
