SUMMARY:George Michael: The Faith Tour
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Andy Morahan\n\nA stunning delve into George Mich
 ael's 1988 Faith Tour\, as shot live at the famous Palais Omnisports de 
 Paris-Bercy. This exclusive footage\, assembled from a 14-camera shoot c
 aptured on 35mm over two nights (30–31 May 1988)\, features the 24-yea
 r-old pop star at the height of his powers.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.or
 g/movie/1649403
