SUMMARY:Nuisance Bear
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Gabriela Osio Vanden\n\nA polar bear is forced to
  navigate a human world of tourists\, wildlife officers\, and hunters as
  its ancient migration collides with modern life. When a sacred predator
  is branded a nuisance\, it becomes unclear who truly belongs in this sh
 ared landscape.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1595210
