SUMMARY:Whiddy (ARTE)
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Adrian McCarthy\n\nFrom ARTE\n\nA small rural com
 munity in Ireland welcomes in a major\, global oil company with open arm
 s but just 10 years and numerous oil spills later\, that dream turns int
 o an unimaginable nightmare. 50 lives lost in a tragedy that silenced an
 d divided the community and still haunts it to this day.\n\nhttps://www.
 themoviedb.org/movie/1637730
