 e diagnosed with cancer at some point in our lives. David Nicholas Wilki
 nson is one of them\, twice over. 1 in 2 follows Wilkinson through his o
 wn treatment\, where he discovers a steep rise in bowel cancer among peo
 ple far too young to be screened for it\, and far too young\, it seems\,
  to be believed.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1771402
