 e Ukrainian mountains\, four women attend therapy sessions to recover fr
 om their very different\, deeply traumatic experiences of the war. They 
 each try\, in their own way\, to resume their former lives.\n\nhttps://w
 ww.themoviedb.org/movie/1796550
