SUMMARY:Blank Patterns
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Alexi Godbout\n\nA collection of athlete portrait
 s following Jacob Bélanger\, Emma Patterson\, and Ugo Troubat. Through 
 their individual stories\, the film explores the experiences\, choices\,
  and communities that shaped the lives they lead today. While each has t
 aken a different path\, together they reflect the many ways people find 
 their place within skiing and contribute to the culture in their own way
 .\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1807429
