SUMMARY:Rehearsals for a Revolution
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Pegah Ahangarani\n\nThrough five portraits of rel
 atives and mentors\, five expressions of resistance\, Pegah Ahangarani s
 ketches her life story. Drawing from personal archives\, home videos\, s
 treet protests footage\, newspapers\, and recorded voices\, she retraces
  more than 40 years of Iran’s history. From the early days of 1979\, u
 ntil the war that began in 2026\, she pieces together intimate and colle
 ctive memories\, forming the portrait of a country shaped by political r
 epression and in constant hope for a revolution.\n\nhttps://www.themovie
 db.org/movie/1666864
